{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u3010Time Slowdown | One-Hit Kill\u3011</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use abilities to temporarily control time flow, parry at the perfect moment, and instantly eliminate enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3197180/extras/88d12129c4f227e6af0791e98426e4ca.poster.avif?t=1757396921\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3197180/extras/88d12129c4f227e6af0791e98426e4ca.webm?t=1757396921\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3197180/extras/88d12129c4f227e6af0791e98426e4ca.mp4?t=1757396921\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u3010Reverse Time and Space | Dual Characters\u3011</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freely switch between temporal identities and flexibly utilize different character skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3197180/extras/7b238a067b542e82019daf43851ffd1c.poster.avif?t=1757396921\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3197180/extras/7b238a067b542e82019daf43851ffd1c.webm?t=1757396921\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3197180/extras/7b238a067b542e82019daf43851ffd1c.mp4?t=1757396921\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u3010Unique Mechanisms | Interactive Puzzles\u3011</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scenes across different timelines feature distinct special mechanisms\u2014outsmarting enemies is more engaging than brute-force slashing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3197180/extras/6161b5c53e588abdd01d78c0e2803228.poster.avif?t=1757396921\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3197180/extras/6161b5c53e588abdd01d78c0e2803228.webm?t=1757396921\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3197180/extras/6161b5c53e588abdd01d78c0e2803228.mp4?t=1757396921\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u3010Fragmented Narrative | Multiple Endings\u3011</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter NPCs from various time periods; your choices will turn them into allies or foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3197180/extras/50a42b6d91a9e1df521e20302c4c14b4.poster.avif?t=1757396921\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3197180/extras/50a42b6d91a9e1df521e20302c4c14b4.webm?t=1757396921\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3197180/extras/50a42b6d91a9e1df521e20302c4c14b4.mp4?t=1757396921\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once the journey begins, the wheel of fate starts to turn.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3197180?t=1757396921","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3197180?t=1757396921","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3197180/b51bda2b611eb69cf73055e789992b3c85b50bdd/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757396921","capsule_imagev5":"https://s